    "Klockerz Krew belongs to the generation of Dominican crews of the 1990s, the period when, next to the big live bands such as <a href=\"/en/wck.html\">WCK</a>, collectives of singers, DJs and producers worked bouyon differently: on machines, on samples, with voices drawn from dancehall, hip hop and R&B. The crew name travels under two spellings in the sources, Klockerz Krew and Klockerz Crew. This profile keeps the first, the one used by the French reference page, and flags the second instead of silently deciding.",
